  "content": "<h1>「探索與傳說」全景光影包</h1><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftrails-and-tales-panorama-with-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1236563/description_42b6a95f-6dc7-4cef-9ed1-6137547cc852.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"55\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/trails-tales-panorama-with-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1236563/description_750b0ba6-3377-43c8-a320-8716c561ae8d.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"55\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/trails-tales-panorama-with-shaders-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1236563/description_23736aa3-64fd-417e-839b-2ac83b71808c.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"55\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252ftrails-tales-panorama-with-shaders-bedrock%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1236563/description_78ebd04b-0ce2-4f36-a3d2-d3784736457c.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"55\"></a></p><p>這是一個非常簡單的資源包，為原始全景圖添加了光影效果。</p><p>該種子由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MinecraftAtHome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft@Home</a>&nbsp;團隊發現。</p><ul>\n<li>種子碼：8554477380691140270</li>\n<li>座標：X=1839.272 Y=128 Z=6312.295</li>\n<li>版本：Minecraft Java 快照 23w14a</li>\n</ul><p>使用的光影為 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.complementary.dev%252freimagined%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Reimagined</a> 光影包。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1080/249/1_20-min.png\" width=\"822\" height=\"435\"></p><p><strong>注意：不包含使用者介面</strong>。</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.creativecommons.org/l/by-nc-sa/4.0/88x31.png\" alt=\"創用 CC 授權條款\"></a></p><p>本作品採用&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">創用 CC 姓名標示-非商業性-相同方式分享 4.0 國際 授權條款</a>授權。<br><br></p><ul>\n<li>歡迎將此資源包包含在您的模組包或伺服器中。</li>\n<li>如果您希望在任何形式的內容中使用此資源包，請盡可能附上原始 PlanetMinecraft/Modrinth/CurseForge 頁面的連結以標示出處。</li>\n</ul>",
